    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Astral Outcast - Spacetime Survival is an open world survival-exploration RPG!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/c90d5d2d4bb3b1137829419360b9dcfa.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=110 /></span><br><br>You've become a spaceship captain who transports supplies to Earth's colony on Mars.<br>On a return trip your ship gets lost on the way back to Earth.<br>Can you find out how to survive in space and get back home?<br>As it seems you are no longer in our own solar system anymore.<br>you will have to start planning your survival and explore an unknown solar system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/6624f37198fd5077467cf3a44b1d8d9c.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=110 /></span><br><br><strong>Survive!</strong> Take care of your oxygen, food, water, sleep and even temperature, radiation and gravity!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/cee9c253fbe19694a94e275fa8eab599.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Maintain your ship!</strong> Your ship will need hydrogen fuel to traverse the vast expanse of space!<br>And also oxygen to create a breathable atmosphere!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/2afc384b6c1d0b2e7bda1570d58c20d2.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Build outposts!</strong> Create a foothold on asteroids, planets, and moons!<br><strong>Farming and Hunting!</strong> You will need to take care of your daily needs! Hunger and hydration!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/d2bd36eb1d3728aa6ca93e54c4705424.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Crafting and Cooking!</strong> Armors, Weapons, Tools and even upgrades for your ship!<br>Create decent meals with the alien flora and fauna you encounter on your travels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/fd064fa5d3e936dfbe3d90a144accf9c.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Explore!</strong> An entire Solar System! Planets, Moons, and Asteroids!<br>And exploit it's resources!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/4217eebbf05d58592a7a8ad6369586ba.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Discord community!</strong> Join us on our Discord!<br>Bug reports and updates are most frequent here!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/6af7ab81017f8ce35a2225adf67f3e90.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Astral Outcast - Spacetime Survival is an open world survival-exploration RPG!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/c90d5d2d4bb3b1137829419360b9dcfa.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=110 /></span><br><br>You've become a spaceship captain who transports supplies to Earth's colony on Mars.<br>On a return trip your ship gets lost on the way back to Earth.<br>Can you find out how to survive in space and get back home?<br>As it seems you are no longer in our own solar system anymore.<br>you will have to start planning your survival and explore an unknown solar system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/6624f37198fd5077467cf3a44b1d8d9c.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=110 /></span><br><br><strong>Survive!</strong> Take care of your oxygen, food, water, sleep and even temperature, radiation and gravity!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/cee9c253fbe19694a94e275fa8eab599.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Maintain your ship!</strong> Your ship will need hydrogen fuel to traverse the vast expanse of space!<br>And also oxygen to create a breathable atmosphere!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/2afc384b6c1d0b2e7bda1570d58c20d2.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Build outposts!</strong> Create a foothold on asteroids, planets, and moons!<br><strong>Farming and Hunting!</strong> You will need to take care of your daily needs! Hunger and hydration!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/d2bd36eb1d3728aa6ca93e54c4705424.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Crafting and Cooking!</strong> Armors, Weapons, Tools and even upgrades for your ship!<br>Create decent meals with the alien flora and fauna you encounter on your travels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/fd064fa5d3e936dfbe3d90a144accf9c.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Explore!</strong> An entire Solar System! Planets, Moons, and Asteroids!<br>And exploit it's resources!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/4217eebbf05d58592a7a8ad6369586ba.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>Discord community!</strong> Join us on our Discord!<br>Bug reports and updates are most frequent here!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/6af7ab81017f8ce35a2225adf67f3e90.avif?t=1748856812\" width=600 height=250 /></span>",
